/* ClipMenu UI strings — Russian. Keys and their order mirror en.lproj.
   Terminology follows DragonKit's ru.lproj and Ice 2's (teddychan/ice-2#132):
   Строка меню, Системные настройки, Универсальный доступ, Правка.
   Russian has three plural forms, so counts are phrased "Label: %d"; a key
   that follows a number the code prints itself uses a count-neutral form
   ("шт.", "симв.") where one exists. "folders" / "snippets" have none: the
   backup row prints "<n> папок", which is wrong after 1–4 until that call
   site formats "Папок: %d" itself. */

